73
00:09:05,265 --> 00:09:10,428
[SPEAKER_02]: Is it something that only comes up in specific instances or specific situations?

74
00:09:12,008 --> 00:09:13,069
[SPEAKER_04]: Well, I guess, I mean...

75
00:09:15,510 --> 00:09:30,920
[SPEAKER_04]: It's an underlying tendency, so maybe the obvious kind of indications that they're present might only come up from time to time, but the fact that they were able to come up indicates that, yeah, the tendency was there.

76
00:09:31,020 --> 00:09:32,681
[SPEAKER_04]: Though that's kind of just repeating what we said.

77
00:09:32,741 --> 00:09:33,241
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah.

78
00:09:33,481 --> 00:09:43,848
[SPEAKER_02]: So, like, the point I'm trying to make is that, obviously, there will be things that are more strongly bound up with those hindrances.

79
00:09:44,435 --> 00:09:48,683
[SPEAKER_02]: But fundamentally, or with the defilements in general, but fundamentally those things...

80
00:09:49,512 --> 00:09:53,433
[SPEAKER_02]: form like the background of your experience in any situation.

81
00:09:53,633 --> 00:09:53,833
[SPEAKER_02]: Yes.

82
00:09:54,093 --> 00:10:05,055
[SPEAKER_02]: So, that means that there is nothing that you can rest assured that this is not unwholesome, that this won't be underlied by one of these unwholesome intentions.

83
00:10:05,735 --> 00:10:08,796
