97
00:12:04,216 --> 00:12:06,317
[SPEAKER_02]: So, that means that then,

98
00:12:08,844 --> 00:12:17,974
[SPEAKER_02]: The kind of carefulness that has to be employed is not on the level of the usual.

99
00:12:18,455 --> 00:12:24,241
[SPEAKER_02]: You know, when monks would really try really hard to protect the vinaya, for example, it would be kind of directed

100
