101
00:12:38,328 --> 00:12:43,992
[SPEAKER_02]: And then, basically, all that means is that you would never be able to be free from doubt.

102
00:12:45,513 --> 00:12:57,064
[SPEAKER_02]: In regard to your own virtue, and in regard to your wholesomeness and unwholesomeness, because somebody else may come along and say, no, no, that in that context, you shouldn't have done this, you should have done something else.

