[SPEAKER_02]: So, the happiness that you would expect to come from your actions is still going to be on the external level, like you would expect, you know, pain not to come to you.

131
00:15:16,804 --> 00:15:21,105
[SPEAKER_02]: But really, the happiness that necessarily comes from virtue is the happiness of

132
