00:24:43,322 --> 00:24:45,143
[SPEAKER_03]: He's still crying about the park.

235
00:24:45,783 --> 00:24:55,209
[SPEAKER_03]: But if you say, no, no, now you're not going to have dinner, you're not going to have anything, you're going to lock it up in the room with dark windows and... Yeah, that will be a punishment of some sort.

236
00:24:55,229 --> 00:25:00,071
[SPEAKER_02]: That's not going to be training it to really kind of get rid of that habit.

